~ sundial
Sundial: {{Campaign.clock_text()}} on day {{Campaign.day_number()}}. {{Campaign.date_text()}}. The weather: {{Campaign.weather_today()}}.
- Look at the calendar (the days, their weather, the moon)
	do Campaign.open_calendar()
- Have a weather now (every one there is)
	do Campaign.open_calendar("weathers")
- Go round every weather, four seconds each
	do Campaign.tour_the_weathers()
- The day's own weather again
	do Campaign.set_weather()
- Watch a whole day go round (twelve seconds)
	do Campaign.watch_time_pass(24.0, 0, 12.0)
- Watch eight hours go by (five seconds)
	do Campaign.watch_time_pass(8.0)
- Watch three days go by (nine seconds)
	do Campaign.watch_time_pass(0.0, 3, 9.0)
- Cut to a time of day
	=> cut
- Cut three days on
	do Campaign.advance_clock(0.0, 3)
- The night has no moon, or has one again
	do Campaign.set_no_moon(not Campaign.map_no_moon)
- The shade with a dithered edge, or not
	do Campaign.set_dithered_light(not LightView.dithered)
- Leave it
=> END

~ cut
Sundial: {{Campaign.clock_text()}}. Which hour?
- Noon
	do Campaign.set_clock(12)
- Dusk
	do Campaign.set_clock(18, 30)
- Night
	do Campaign.set_clock(22)
- Dawn
	do Campaign.set_clock(6, 30)
- Leave it
=> END
